      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The design and methodology are presented of a national survey that is in progress in Belgium relating dietary habits, coronary risk factors and mortality rates on a regional basis. The reasons and objectives of the study are explained. The sampling procedures and the survey methodology, in particular the measures of dietary habits, are presented and discussed."},
